@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Welcome to Zamba Farm";
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Zamba Farm - Home</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
    
    <div  class=" mt-2">
        <!-- Header -->
        <section id="hero" class="d-flex align-items-center" style="background-image: url('https://www.rspca.org.uk/documents/d/rspca/1073910-outdoor-piglets_3x2-min?imagePreview=1'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;">
            <div class="container text-center" data-aos="zoom-in">
                <h1>Welcome to Zamba Farm!</h1>
                <h2>A Home Full of Paws, Hooves and Wings.</h2>
                <!-- <a href="/services.html#services" class="btn btn-primary mt-4">Explore Our Services</a> -->
            </div>
        </section>



        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="text-center green " data-aos=" fade-up">
          
            <div class="container py-3">
                <h2 class="mt-3 shad ">About Us</h2>
                <p data-aos="fade-right">
                    Mazambani Farm is home to many different kind of species of animals and crops.
                    Among the animals we hosts we have Pigs, Chickens, Rabbits, Ducks, catttle, Goats and Pigeons which are very healthy as we have an animal vet who comes regularly to dose and check for diseases on animals. On the agricultural side we do hot culture- (green vegetables, tomatoes, onions, cabages) maize for animal feed, tobacco, sugar beans and soya beans.
                </p>
                <p data-aos="fade-left">We are dedicated to sustainability and self-reliance through crop cultivation. We grow maize, sunflower, and soya beans, which we will soon start grinding to create highly nutritious feed for our animals. A milling machine is set to arrive soon, enabling us to produce specialized feed such as rabbit pellets, chicken feed, pig feed, and cattle feed. Additionally, we are preparing a vast expanse of land in Masvingo for grassland, specifically for the grazing of our cattle and goats. Irrigation systems and fencing are already in progress to ensure the grassland thrives as a vital resource for our livestock.</p>


                <p data-aos="fade-up">At Mazambani Farm, we take pride in organizing our animals in spaces best suited to their needs. Our goats and cattle reside in the serene fields of Masvingo, where they have ample space to graze and thrive. The pigs, on the other hand, enjoy their own dedicated area in Mapinga, ensuring a comfortable and well-equipped environment tailored to their nature. Meanwhile, the birds—including chickens, ducks, turkeys, and even rabbits—are housed in Harare, where we’ve created a secure and nurturing setting for their well-being.</p>
                <br>

                <a href="#learnMore" class="btn btn-success">Learn More</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <section class="values ">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Values</h2>

                <div data-aos=" fade-left">
                    <div class="values-box " >
                        <br>
                        <h3 data-aos=" fade-left">Protecting the lane</h3>
                        <p data-aos=" fade-right">we continously strive to improve our soil by growing a wide variety of crops, to give a balanced rotation to the farm, and utilising the manure from our animals as a natural fertiliser to reduce the need for synthetic fertiliser</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="values-box" data-aos=" fade-right">
                    <h3 data-aos=" fade-left">Respecting our animals</h3>
                    <p data-aos=" fade-right">Our animals enjoy the best possible welfare. we ensure access to lots of space, both inside and outside, which helps them to express natural behaviours and to live happ and contended lives</p>
                </div>

                <div class="values-box" data-aos=" fade-left">
                    <H3>Increasing Biodiversity</H3>
                    <p>By planting grass margins and field corners we actively encourage a wider divesity of plants, insects, birds and mammals across the farm. We plant new hedges and manage existing ones to help protect the wildlife around us, through out the year.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="values-box" data-aos=" fade-right">
                    <h3>Supporting </h3>
                    <p>We are focused on succefully growing our family business and committed to making a positive impact on the communities where we live and work. Not only through what we produce but what we give back through our charitable activies</p>
                </div>

                <div class="values-box" data-aos=" fade-up">
                    <h3>Improving climate</h3>
                    <p>We actively plan for carbon sequestration across our forests and soil, and we endevourto waste nothing, from the grains we grow being incoporated into our animals' diet, and th straw we use to bed them up.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="animal-species">
            <h2 data-aos="fade-down">Animal Species</h2>
            <div class="card-container">
                <!-- Rabbit Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.efWYpdx5xt5L5SeKYnZqrAHaHu?rs=1&pid=ImgDetMain" alt="Rabbits">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Rabbits</h3>
                        <p>Learn more about our rabbits and their nurturing environment.</p>
                        <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Rabbits" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-success">Explore Rabbits</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Chicken Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.3SKhDbVeRzvRZOI7vRo1fAHaG5?w=1051&h=980&rs=1&pid=ImgDetMain" alt="Chickens">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Chickens</h3>
                        <p>Discover how we care for our chickens at ZambaFarm.</p>
                        <a href="chickens.html" class="btn btn-success">Explore Chickens</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Duck Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
                    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.xWzsFoxN1Ush3LhCvyR-pgHaK_?rs=1&pid=ImgDetMain" alt="Ducks">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Ducks</h3>
                        <p>Find out more about our ducks and their habitat.</p>
                        <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Ducks" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-success">Explore Ducks</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Turkey Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
                    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.q5U3f1a-KJ6PwVIuz3YueAHaHa?rs=1&pid=ImgDetMain" alt="Turkeys">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Turkeys</h3>
                        <p>Get to know our turkeys and their home.</p>
                        <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Turkeys" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-success">Explore Turkeys</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Pig Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
                    <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/474x/a6/6a/bf/a66abf17b9f0ad22922b3fab127ea48a--funny-pigs-cute-pigs.jpg" alt="Pigs">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Pigs</h3>
                        <p>Learn about our pigs in Mapinga.</p>
                        <a asp-action="" asp-controller="Pigs" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-success">Explore Pigs</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Goat Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="600">
                    <img src="https://img.freepik.com/premium-vector/cute-goat-cartoon-white-background_43633-12283.jpg?w=2000" alt="Goats">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Goats</h3>
                        <p>Explore the goats grazing in Masvingo.</p>
                        <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Goats" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-success">Explore Goats</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Cattle Card -->
                <div class="card" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="700">
                    <img src="https://th.bing.com/th/id/OIP.kbwe6pBovGacJ8yNETymzwHaE8?rs=1&pid=ImgDetMain" alt="Cattle">
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <h3>Cattle</h3>
                        <p>Learn about our cattle in the grasslands of Masvingo.</p>         
                        <a asp-area="" asp-controller="Cattles" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-success">Explore Cattle</a>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact-form" class="contact-section">
            <div class="container mt-5">
                <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                <div class="contact-form">
                    <form id="contactForm" action="https://formsubmit.co/18d69851a769661bf305a83b6324a105" method="POST">
                        <div class="form-row">
                            <div class="form-group col-md-6">
                                <label for="name">Name</label>
                                <input type="text" name="Name" class="form-control" id="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group col-md-6">
                                <label for="email">Email</label>
                                <input type="email" name="email " class="form-control" id="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-row">
                            <div class="form-group col-md-6">
                                <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
                                <input type="tel" name="phone " class="form-control" id="phone" placeholder="Your Phone Number" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group col-md-6">
                                <label for="subject">Subject</label>
                                <input type="text" name="subject " class="form-control" id="subject" placeholder="Subject" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label for="message">Message</label>
                            <textarea class="form-control" name="message" id="message" rows="5" placeholder="Your Message" required></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-2">Send Message</button>
                        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://mufarodemo5.wuaze.com/thanks.html">
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <br />
        <hr />



    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script >
        AOS.init({
            duration: 1200, // Animation duration in milliseconds
            once: true // Animation should happen only once
        });


        $(document).ready(function () {
            // Smooth scrolling for links
            $('a.nav-link').on('click', function (event) {
                if (this.hash !== "") {
                    event.preventDefault();
                    var hash = this.hash;
                    $('html, body').animate({
                        scrollTop: $(hash).offset().top
                    }, 800, function () {
                        window.location.hash = hash;
                    });
                }
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>